    "reason": "Reviewed CORE and LAYOUTS against the current feature index and display contract. Dot removal, the connection footer and brightness scheduling preserve the published setup, independent gauge operation and reading layouts. The feature-index additions do not change public access to virtual gauges, subscriptions or vehicle controls. The OLED offer still includes its preinstalled software major and remains inquiry-only. The separately priced Vgate is optional on both gauge offers. The foreground location retry for sunset brightness changes setup error handling and leaves the published layout claim unchanged. Mobile companion branding now reflects Android availability and the owner-prioritized iPhone follow-up for essential setup. USB configuration and broader vehicle profiles remain planned.",
